}{\plain \fs20 \i\f1\fs20 To be said or sung, kneeling, standing, or in procession; before the\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f1\fs20 Eucharist or after the Collects of Morning or Evening Prayer; or\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f1\fs20 separately; especially in Lent and on Rogation days.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 O God the Father, Creator of heaven and earth,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Have mercy upon us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs24 \f1 O God the Son, Redeemer of the world,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Have mercy upon us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs24 \f1 O God the Holy Ghost, Sanctifier of the faithful,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Have mercy upon us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs24 \f1 O holy, blessed, and glorious Trinity, one God,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Have mercy upon us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 Remember not, Lord Christ, our offenses, nor the offenses\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 of our forefathers; neither reward us according to our sins.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 Spare us, good Lord, spare thy people, whom thou hast\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 redeemed with thy most precious blood, and by thy mercy\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 preserve us for ever.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Spare us, good Lord.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 From all evil and wickedness; from sin; from the crafts\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 and assaults of the devil; and from everlasting damnation,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Good Lord, deliver us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\column 
\pard \fs24\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs24 \f1 From all blindness of heart; from pride, vainglory, and \softline
hypocrisy; from envy, hatred, and malice; and from all want\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 of charity,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Good Lord, deliver us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs24 \f1 From all inordinate and sinful affections; and from all the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 deceits of the world, the flesh, and the devil,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Good Lord, deliver us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs24 \f1 From all false doctrine, heresy, and schism; from hardness\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 of heart, and contempt of thy Word and commandment,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Good Lord, deliver us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs24 \f1 From lightning and tempest; from earthquake, fire, and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 flood; from plague, pestilence, and famine,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Good Lord, deliver us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs24 \f1 From all oppression, conspiracy, and rebellion; from\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 violence, battle, and murder; and from dying suddenly\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 and unprepared,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Good Lord, deliver us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 By the mystery of thy holy Incarnation; by thy holy Nativity\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 and submission to the Law; by thy Baptism, Fasting, and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 Temptation,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Good Lord, deliver us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs24 \f1 By thine Agony and Bloody Sweat; by thy Cross and Passion;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 by thy precious Death and Burial; by thy glorious Resurrection\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 and Ascension; and by the Coming of the Holy Ghost,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Good Lord, deliver us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx0\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs24 \f1 In all time of our tribulation; in all time of our prosperity; in\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 the hour of death, and in the day of judgment,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f1 Good Lord, deliver us.}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1  \par
